{
  "date": "2025-12-10",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "라이브 잘 봤오~?",
      "en": "Did you enjoy the live~?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 모씽기게 나와서",
      "en": "I looked so ugly in it,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아쉽",
      "en": "it's a shame."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 완전 인기쟁이였어",
      "en": "I was super popular today."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "항상 뽀뽀는 내가 했ㄴ느데",
      "en": "I'm always the one giving kisses,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "양쪽에서 막",
      "en": "but today, from both sides,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "날 왤케 좋아하는거야",
      "en": "everyone kept liking me so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "항상 말하지만",
      "en": "Like I always say,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 당하는건 부끄러워",
      "en": "I'm embarrassed when I'm on the receiving end."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 하는것만 좋아 ㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ",
      "en": "I only like being the one doing it. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 김수민 나한테 찐으로 설레하는것같아서",
      "en": "Lately it feels like Kim Soomin genuinely gets flustered because of me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무섭다",
      "en": "it's kind of scary."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저번에 같이 쇼핑 가서도",
      "en": "Even when we went shopping together last time,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸",
      "en": "she kept saying,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너 왤케 스윗해?",
      "en": "\"Why are you so sweet?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너 왤케 쿨해?",
      "en": "\"Why are you so cool?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸",
      "en": "over and over."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭘 하지도 않음",
      "en": "I didn't even do anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "김채원 질투중 ㅋ",
      "en": "Kim Chaewon is jealous. ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정혜린도 전에는 내가 뽀뽀하면",
      "en": "Jeong Hyerin used to react whenever I tried to kiss her,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 왜이래!! 미쳤지",
      "en": "\"Ah, what's wrong with you!! Are you crazy?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러는데",
      "en": "she'd say,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘은 걍 받던데",
      "en": "but these days she just accepts it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "체념한건가 아님 좋은건가 ㅋ",
      "en": "Did she give up, or does she actually like it? ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 진짜 요즘 멤버들 내 뽀뽀 왜 안피함",
      "en": "Seriously though, why don't the members avoid my kisses anymore?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내성 생겼나",
      "en": "Did they build up immunity?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유빈언니도 안피함",
      "en": "Even Yubin-unnie doesn't dodge them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아까 오랜만에 방 찾아갔는데",
      "en": "Earlier I went to her room for the first time in a while,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뽀뽀하는데 걍 얼굴을 내줌",
      "en": "and when I went in for a kiss, she just offered me her face."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재미없어지네",
      "en": "It's not as fun anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아 뽀뽀가 좋은게 아니라 피하는 반응이 좋은거였어??",
      "en": "Oh, so it wasn't the kiss itself—you liked seeing them try to avoid it??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그치",
      "en": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "귀엽잖아 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "It's cute. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이제 24명 다해본듯",
      "en": "I think I've done it to all 24 members now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미션 클리어~",
      "en": "Mission cleared~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ 한명은 나",
      "en": "Ah, ㅋㅋㅋ one of them was me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "셀프뽀뽀 맞앜ㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "A self-kiss counts too. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 그리고",
      "en": "Oh, and also..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내친구가",
      "en": "My friend"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸 자기 알고리즘에 내가 뜨는데",
      "en": "keeps getting me recommended by their algorithm,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 꼴보기 싫어서",
      "en": "and because they can't stand seeing me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다 관심없음 누르는데도",
      "en": "they keep pressing 'Not Interested,'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "계속 뜬다고",
      "en": "but I still keep showing up."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "느끼한짓좀 하지 말라는거야",
      "en": "They told me to stop acting so cheesy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "느끼빼면 시체인데",
      "en": "But if you take away my cheesiness, I'm basically a corpse."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어케 빼는건데",
      "en": "How am I even supposed to do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 스포하고싶은거 있는데..",
      "en": "Also, there's something I want to spoil..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "노래를 불렀어",
      "en": "I recorded a song."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 좀 잘한듯",
      "en": "And I think I actually did pretty well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "계속 들음 혼자서 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "I've been listening to it over and over by myself. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔지는",
      "en": "What it is,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안알려줌",
      "en": "I'm not telling you."
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "더해주세요스포를",
      "en": "Please give us more spoilers."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음…",
      "en": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "발음 칭찬을 많이 받았어",
      "en": "I got a lot of compliments on my pronunciation."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "생각의 자유",
      "en": "Freedom of thought."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "끝~",
      "en": "That's all~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "키ㅣ키킼ㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 곧 가대축이잖아",
      "en": "And the KBS Song Festival is coming up soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 넘 설레",
      "en": "I'm so excited."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 잘하고싶어",
      "en": "I really want to do well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게 하면 더 멋있게 할수있을까",
      "en": "I keep wondering how I can make it even cooler."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "설렌다",
      "en": "I'm excited."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무대는 항상 설래",
      "en": "Being on stage always excites me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "레",
      "en": "Exci-"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벌써 연말 무대라니…",
      "en": "It's already the year-end stages..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 올해 별로 안남았다",
      "en": "There really isn't much of this year left."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "크리스마스가 안왔으면 좋겠어",
      "en": "I wish Christmas wouldn't come."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시간이 넘 빠르잖아..",
      "en": "Time is going by way too fast..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "**Y/n**만의 고딩 못해 이제?",
      "en": "I can't be **Y/n**'s high school girl anymore?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 달라지는건 없겠지만",
      "en": "Nothing about me will really change,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 성인이라는 타이틀이",
      "en": "but somehow, the title of 'adult'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "넘 빨라",
      "en": "came way too quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 철들면 어떡해.. 벌써너무무섭다",
      "en": "What if Hayeon becomes mature... I'm already scared."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이미 철 들었다면? ㅋ",
      "en": "What if I've already matured? ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "무거워졌겠지.",
      "en": "Then you'd have gotten heavier."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무거워지긴 함",
      "en": "I did get heavier."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "철들어서 무거워진거구나",
      "en": "So I got heavier because I 'got iron' (matured)."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "철 빼야지",
      "en": "Guess I should take the iron out."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아니 요즘 왤케 동그래졌어",
      "en": "But seriously, why has your face gotten so round lately?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그거 철들어서 무거워져서그래",
      "en": "Because I 'got iron' and became heavier."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 나도 놀라워",
      "en": "Even I'm surprised these days."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "얼굴이 그냥",
      "en": "My face is just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "동글.",
      "en": "Round."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 시러!",
      "en": "I seriously hate it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "피씨방 알바하면서 많이 먹은거야?",
      "en": "Did you eat a lot while working part-time at the PC bang?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅌㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅎㅋㅎㅋㅎㅋㅎㅋㅎ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그것도 봤어?",
      "en": "You saw that too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그거 촬영하면서",
      "en": "While filming that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "대기실이 그",
      "en": "the waiting room was basically"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다인원 피씨실?",
      "en": "a big multiplayer PC room."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이였는데",
      "en": "It was."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오버워치하면서",
      "en": "While playing Overwatch,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "라면이랑 타코야끼랑 닭강정이랑 감자랑",
      "en": "we ordered ramyeon, takoyaki, dakgangjeong, and fries,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시켜서 서연언니랑",
      "en": "and with Seoyeon-unnie,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "먹으면서 기다림",
      "en": "we waited while eating."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그날 완전 부어서",
      "en": "I was so swollen that day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게 나오려나 ㅠㅠㅠ 했는데",
      "en": "I was worried about how I'd look. ㅠㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "최초치초치최최악은 아니여서",
      "en": "Thankfully, it wasn't the absolute worst."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "넘 다행",
      "en": "I'm really relieved."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "밸리곰같고 좋았어",
      "en": "You looked like Bellygom. I liked it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그걸 노린거지",
      "en": "That's exactly what I was going for."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벨리곰이 되.",
      "en": "Become Bellygom."
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 성인 로망 아직 새벽피시방이야?",
      "en": "Is your adult dream still going to a PC bang late at night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그게 크지",
      "en": "That's a big one."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 혼자 피시방 가서",
      "en": "Going to a PC bang by myself,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하고 싶은 게임 마스터 해서",
      "en": "mastering all the games I want to play,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맛있는거 막 먹고",
      "en": "and eating lots of delicious food."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "프로게이머 데뷔하는거임?",
      "en": "So you're debuting as a pro gamer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "티원 껴주세요..",
      "en": "T1, please let me join..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "애쉬로 정글 안갈게요 ㅠㅠㅠㅠ",
      "en": "I promise I won't play Ashe jungle. ㅠㅠㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "프로게이머 활동명 정하자",
      "en": "Let's decide your pro gamer nickname."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐가 좋을까",
      "en": "What would be good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 페이커가 아닌",
      "en": "Instead of Faker,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "페이크로 할게",
      "en": "I'll go with Fake."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "페이작아",
      "en": "Or 'Pay Small.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이것도 좋다",
      "en": "That's a good one too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "페이커님의 페이 100프로를 뺀 금액으로",
      "en": "You can hire me for Faker's salary minus 100%."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "절 섭외할수 있습니다",
      "en": "That's my booking fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "불러만주시면",
      "en": "As long as you call me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정글 안가고",
      "en": "I won't go jungle,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "집에만 있을게요",
      "en": "I'll just stay at base."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "상점주인처럼",
      "en": "Like the shopkeeper."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그치 치어리더…",
      "en": "Right... cheerleader..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "치워리더 ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "Clean-up leader. ㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아아 이게 그뜻이였군",
      "en": "Ahh, so that's what you meant."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "여기서부터 복선이...",
      "en": "This is where the foreshadowing begins..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이걸 노렸네..",
      "en": "So this was your setup..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "배텐에서 한 말이 거짓말은 아니였어",
      "en": "Then what I said on BaeTen wasn't a lie."
